@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama CD 4: PUT /api/v1/distributors/:id (Actualizar Datos y Coordenadas del Depósito)

actor "Planificador" as User
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Distributor Service" as Service
participant "distributors DB" as DistDB

User -> Web: Mueve el depósito en el mapa / Modifica nombre y pulsa "Guardar Cambios"
Web -> Gateway: PUT /api/v1/distributors/501\n{ name, latitude, longitude }
Gateway -> Service: updateDistributor(id, updateDto, executorId)

Service -> DistDB: findActiveById(id)
DistDB --> Service: existingDistributor (o null)

alt Centro no encontrado
    Service --> Gateway: 404 Not Found (Centro no encontrado)
    Gateway --> Web: 404 Not Found
    Web --> User: Muestra notificación de error
else Centro encontrado
    Service -> Service: validateCoordinates(latitude, longitude)
    Service -> DistDB: updateDistributorRecord(id, updateDto, executorId)
    DistDB --> Service: updatedRecord (id, name, lat, lng, updatedAt)

    Service -> Service: buildUpdateResponse(updatedRecord)
    Service --> Gateway: updateResponse
    Gateway --> Web: 200 OK (Centro actualizado)
    Web --> User: Actualiza posición del depósito en el mapa y panel de detalle
end
@enduml
